        "explanation": "Doctor maintained continuity by tying formal reports and endocrine appointment timing to future updates.",
        "quote": "尿培养正式报告拿到了、内分泌门诊约到哪天"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00088",
        "explanation": "Doctor recognized fever plus lethargy, poor intake, and near-anuria as urgent triage information.",
        "quote": "是急诊分诊的红灯信号"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00332",
        "explanation": "Doctor gave clear home red flags after discharge.",
        "quote": "任意一条出现，直接去最近医院儿科急诊"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00044",
        "explanation": "Doctor adapted to distance and feasibility by recommending nearby pediatric emergency care rather than the original hospital.",
        "quote": "不专门跑回原来住院那家医院"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00352",
        "explanation": "Doctor adapted follow-up to practical scheduling and delay risk.",
        "quote": "如果几天内约不到"
      }
    ]
  },
  "dimension_ratings": {
    "actionability_responsibility_chain": "partial",
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": "excellent",
    "continuity_memory_focus": "good",
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": "good",
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": "excellent"
  },
  "high_order_assessment": [
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00044",
          "explanation": "Doctor provided a lower-burden but safe acute-care path instead of requiring return to the original hospital.",
          "quote": "就近先看"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00352",
          "explanation": "Doctor gave a concrete timing target for endocrine follow-up to prevent indefinite delay.",
          "quote": "目标是：出院后 1–2 周内看上内分泌门诊"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor recognized distance/work constraints and created a staged plan: nearby acute pediatric/emergency evaluation first, then active phone/clinic scheduling for endocrine follow-up. This had meaningful trajectory impact because the family used nearby emergency care and later obtained an endocrine appointment.",
