          "explanation": "Doctor repaired an execution risk when the caregiver could not read the antipyretic concentration.",
          "quote": "看不清药盒浓度和每次毫升数，就不要自己硬喂"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00081",
          "explanation": "Family followed the repaired plan while traveling to care.",
          "quote": "路上没给那个看不清剂量的退烧药"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "When the caregiver was hesitant about medication and logistics, the doctor gave a concrete safer workaround—bring the drug box and let emergency staff verify dosing—while preserving the urgent evaluation plan. This repaired the execution chain and changed the family's behavior.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
