          "explanation": "Family confirmed understanding of the action plan and return triggers.",
          "quote": "4小时没尿、高烧压不住这些就直接回儿科或急诊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC7 was met: the doctor closed with red flags, home execution steps, follow-up ownership, and the caregiver demonstrated understanding of the plan and escalation triggers.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC7",
      "status": "met"
    }
  ]
}
